<< /Length 1951 >>
stream
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 720 Td (John Carlton is a famous and successful businessman today.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 690 Td (He writes special messages called advertisements that help people sell things.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 660 Td (He is so good at it that people pay him thousands of dollars just to talk to him.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 630 Td (But he was not always successful, and in fact he started out with almost nothing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 600 Td (When John was thirty years old, he hit rock bottom in just two months.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 570 Td (He lost his job, his relationship, and the place where he used to live.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 540 Td (He had to sleep on the couches of his friends and he had very little money.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 510 Td (One day he woke up and realized a simple but powerful truth about his life.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 480 Td (Nobody was coming to rescue him, so he would have to make it happen himself.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 450 Td (He decided to start his own business as a freelance writer for other companies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 420 Td (His friends and family thought he was crazy because he knew nothing about business.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 390 Td (Every morning he would drive to the public library and read everything he could.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 360 Td (He studied the old masters of persuasion and copied their letters by hand.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 330 Td (Slowly, and with a great deal of practice, his writing began to improve.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 300 Td (The first client he landed paid him only a small amount for a great deal of work.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 270 Td (But that first success gave him the confidence to keep going and to charge more.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 240 Td (Within a few years he had built a reputation as one of the best in the industry.) Tj ET
BT /F1 13 Tf 64 210 Td (Today he shares the lessons he learned so that others can avoid the same mistakes.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
